    "# Week 4: Gold-Only Model Training & Selection\n",
    "\n",
    "**Project**: Explainable Fake Review Detection for Bangla\n",
    "**Course**: CSE 4262 Data Analytics Lab\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook implements Week 4:\n",
    "1. Load model-ready data from Week 3\n",
    "2. Train 5 classifiers on gold train set\n",
    "3. Hyperparameter tuning for LR and GBT via cross-validation\n",
    "4. Evaluate on validation set (macro-F1, PR-AUC primary)\n",
    "5. Select best model for pseudo-labeling\n",
    "6. Save models and validation predictions\n",
    "\n",
    "**Models**: Logistic Regression, Naive Bayes, Linear SVC, Random Forest, Gradient-Boosted Trees\n",
    "**Metrics**: Macro-F1 (primary), PR-AUC (primary), Accuracy, ROC-AUC, Per-class P/R/F1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
